  <h1>II. Introduction (continued)</h1>

  <h2>C. Current Operations and Competitive Landscape</h2>

  <p>Prosper's pharmacy market is <strong>highly competitive</strong>, dominated by major chains. StarCare competes against CVS (multiple locations), Walmart Pharmacy, H-E-B Pharmacy, and Costco Pharmacy — all of which have scale, digital infrastructure, and loyalty programs that StarCare lacks. However, the JD Power 2025 U.S. Pharmacy Study reveals that chain drug stores scored just <strong>643/1,000</strong> — the lowest of any pharmacy type — while chain drug store customers are significantly more likely to switch pharmacies in the next 12 months than any other segment. This creates a unique opportunity for StarCare to capture and retain displaced patients.</p>

