  <div class="key-insight">
    <strong>THE STRATEGIC IMPERATIVE</strong>
    StarCare Pharmacy has the strongest natural loyalty asset in the Prosper market: a genuine, relationship-based connection with its patients. But that asset is unsustained — it lives in individual staff memory, not in a system. Project Swastik transforms StarCare's greatest strength into a <em>sustainable competitive advantage</em>: a loyalty framework that chains cannot replicate because it is rooted in community, not scale. The next section translates this framework into an actionable 12-month strategic plan.
  </div>

