  <div class="key-insight">
    <strong>THE APOLLO PHARMACY LESSON</strong>
    Apollo Pharmacy's CRM drove a 46% increase in revenue from existing customers by personalizing every touchpoint: abandoned cart recovery, targeted loyalty rewards, and automated refill reminders. StarCare's personalization engine achieves the same result — but at a fraction of the cost, using existing staff relationships rather than a sophisticated tech platform.
  </div>

