      <td>Prosper ISD health education</td>
      <td>Sponsor first aid / health modules in school curriculum; provide branded first aid kits at back-to-school events</td>
      <td>15,000+ students and families</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Prosper soccer / sports teams</td>
      <td>Official pharmacy sponsor of youth soccer league; branded bandanas with StarCare logo</td>
      <td>2,000+ families per season</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Prosper Chamber of Commerce</td>
      <td>Annual membership; participate in Prosper Fest, Main Street events</td>
      <td>500+ local business owners and residents</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Food drive / community giving</td>
      <td>Monthly in-store donation bin; Wellness Rewards members earn 10 bonus points per kg of food donated</td>
      <td>300+ households per month</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3>Initiative 3.3: Wellness Workshops</h3>

  <p>Monthly 30-minute wellness workshops at StarCare Pharmacy, open to all community members. Workshops are promoted through the Wellness Rewards program (attendance earns 30 points) and serve as a foot-traffic driver:</p>

  <table>
