  <div class="key-insight">
    <strong>WHY COMMUNITY ROOTS BEAT LOYALTY POINTS</strong>
    CVS can give you $1 back. StarCare can tell you how to manage your child's seasonal allergies, sponsor their soccer team, and send you a handwritten wellness card in December. Chains have loyalty programs. StarCare will have <em>roots</em>. That is the difference between transactional loyalty and emotional loyalty — and emotional loyalty is what keeps patients for years, not months.
  </div>

