  <p>Project Swastik is designed to deliver measurable improvements across all key loyalty metrics. The projections below are based on industry benchmarks from the Apollo Pharmacy CRM case study, JD Power pharmacy benchmarks, and NCPA independent pharmacy data. They will be validated and refined with primary data collected during the baseline phase.</p>

