    Every dollar invested in Project Swastik returns $4.91 in Year 1. But the true value extends beyond Year 1: once a patient joins the Wellness Rewards program and builds a household account, they are unlikely to leave. The loyalty dividend compounds. By Year 2, the projected ROI exceeds 200% as the patient base stabilizes and lifetime value increases.
