    <strong>FROM THIS ENTRY</strong>
    The next section presents the budget required to implement Project Swastik — a detailed, line-by-line breakdown of the $14,000 investment. Every dollar is accounted for, every cost is justified, and every expense maps to a specific initiative in the strategic plan.
  </div>

