  <div class="key-insight">
    <strong>BUDGET PHILOSOPHY</strong>
    Project Swastik is designed to be <em>capital-light</em>: no software licenses, no agency fees, no expensive technology. The largest single expense is wellness bundle inventory ($3,000), which is also a revenue-generating asset (bundles can be sold or redeemed). The budget scales with performance: as Wellness Rewards enrollment grows, point redemption costs are offset by increased prescription and OTC revenue.
  </div>

